  "translation": "Ndipo anauka mmamawa, natuluka kulimbikira ku chilengomtengo cha Tekoa; ndipo potuluka kwawo, Yehoshafati anayimirira, nati: “Ndimvereni inu, Yehuda ndi okhala ku Yerushalayimu! Khulupirirani mwa Yahwe, Elohim wanu, ndipo mudzakhalabe okhazikika; khulupirirani maneneri ake, ndipo mudzakondwera zabwino.”",
